{"text": "Near a big forest lived a poor woodcutter with his wife and two children. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The boy was called Hansel, and the girl was called Gretel. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then hard times came, and there was not enough bread. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One night the father was lying in bed and worrying. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His wife said, We must take the children into the forest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> We will leave them there, and then we will have more bread. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The father was very sad, but at last he agreed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The children were too hungry to sleep, so they heard everything. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Gretel cried, but Hansel said, Do not worry, I will find a way. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Later he went outside, and the white pebbles were shining like silver coins. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He filled his pockets with them and went back to bed.", "alignment": {"characters": ["N", "e", "a", "r", " ", "a", " ", "b", "i", "g", " ", "f", "o", "r", "e", "s", "t", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", "d", " ", "a", " ", "p", "o", "o", "r", " ", "w", "o", "o", "d", "c", "u", "t", "t", "e", "r", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "w", "i", "f", "e", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "w", "o", " ", "c", "h", "i", "l", "d", "r", "e", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "b", "o", "y", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "c", "a", "l", "l", "e", "d", " ", "H", "a", "n", "s", "e", "l", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "g", "i", "r", "l", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "c", "a", "l", "l", "e", "d", " ", "G", "r", "e", "t", "e", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", "n", " ", "h", "a", "r", "d", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "s", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "w", 